assertion_line: 11
expression: setup.render_long_help().to_string()
---
Configure a direct AIRS gateway connection for this standalone terminal

Usage: setup [OPTIONS] --gateway-url <GATEWAY_URL> --context-window <CONTEXT_WINDOW>

Options:
      --gateway-url <GATEWAY_URL>
          AIRS inference API root, including the deployment's /v1 prefix

      --credential-env <CREDENTIAL_ENV>
          Environment variable containing the workspace credential (not its value)
          
          [default: AIRS_API_KEY]

      --context-window <CONTEXT_WINDOW>
          Administrator-confirmed context limit valid for every configured route

      --model <MODEL>
          Authorized explicit @provider/model entries. Repeat to add entries

      --allow-http-loopback
          Permit plain HTTP only for a loopback test gateway

  -h, --help
          Print help
